=====Usage notes=====
When compounding, makes the accent fall on the {{m|ja|自立拍|tr=jiritsuhaku||autonomous mora}} immediately before itself. For example:
* {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|中国}} ({{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|ちゅうごく|ちゅꜜうごく}}) + {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|人}} → {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|中国人}} ({{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|ちゅうごくじん|ちゅうご'''く'''ꜜじん}})
* {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|アメリカ}} + {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|人}} → {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|アメリカ人}} ({{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|アメリカじん|アメリ'''カ'''ꜜじん}})
* {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|朝鮮}} ({{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|ちょうせん|ちょうせꜜん}}) + {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|人}} → {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|朝鮮人}} ({{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|ちょうせんじん|ちょう'''せ'''ꜜんじん}}; {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|ん}} is a {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|特殊拍|tr=tokushuhaku||special mora}}, therefore accentless)
* {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|スペイン|スペꜜイン}} + {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|人}} → {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|スペイン人}} ({{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|スペインじん|スペ'''イ'''ꜜンじん}}; {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|ン}} is a {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|特殊拍|tr=tokushuhaku||special mora}}, therefore accentless)
* {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|ノルウェー|ノルウェꜜー}} + {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|人}} → {{m|ja|ノルウェー人}} ({{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|ノルウェーじん|ノル'''ウェ'''ꜜーじん}}; {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|ー}} is a {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|特殊拍|tr=tokushuhaku||special mora}}, therefore accentless)
There is one notable exception:
* {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|日本}} ({{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|にほん|にほꜜん}}/{{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|にっぽん|にっぽꜜん}}) + {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|人}} → {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|日本人}} ({{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|にほんじん|にほん'''じ'''ꜜん}}/{{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|にっぽんじん|にっぽん'''じ'''ꜜん}})

